{"id":"bs06","name":"Three-Day Login Streaks","lang":"sql","entry":null,"params":[],"limit_s":10,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>The engagement team looks for users with login streaks. You have the table <b>logins</b> with the columns <code>user_id</code> and <code>login_at</code> (timestamp). A user can log in several times the same day.</p>\n<p>A <b>streak</b> is a maximal series of consecutive calendar days with at least one login each day.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return the users whose longest streak is <b>at least 3 days</b>, with the columns <code>user_id</code> and <code>longest_streak</code> (in days), sorted by <code>longest_streak</code> descending, then <code>user_id</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>Table <code>logins</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>user_id</th><th>login_at</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2026-02-14 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2026-02-13 10:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2026-02-12 08:30:00</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>2026-02-11 22:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>2026-02-14 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>2026-02-12 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>2026-02-11 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>2026-02-10 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>2026-02-14 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>2026-02-12 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>2026-02-09 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>2026-02-08 09:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>2026-02-08 18:00:00</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>2026-02-07 09:00:00</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>user_id</th><th>longest_streak</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>3</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 10 seconds (psql)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB</div>","starter":"/* Write your PostgreSQL query here */\n","hints":["Enlève d'abord les doublons (SELECT DISTINCT user_id, ts::date) : sinon ROW_NUMBER compte deux fois le même jour.","Dans une série de jours consécutifs, jour - ROW_NUMBER() est constant : c'est la clé du groupe (l'île)."],"summary_fr":"Trouver les utilisateurs qui se sont connectés au moins 3 jours calendaires consécutifs, avec la longueur de leur plus longue série. Attention aux connexions en double le même jour.","tags":["gaps and islands","DISTINCT avant fenêtre","date - ROW_NUMBER"],"minutes":15,"source":"shawlu95/Beyond-LeetCode-SQL (MIT) · Consecutive Active Users","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"tables":{"logins":{"columns":[["user_id","INT"],["login_at","TIMESTAMP"]],"rows":[[1,"2026-02-14 09:00:00"],[1,"2026-02-13 10:00:00"],[1,"2026-02-12 08:30:00"],[1,"2026-02-11 22:00:00"],[2,"2026-02-14 09:00:00"],[2,"2026-02-12 09:00:00"],[2,"2026-02-11 09:00:00"],[2,"2026-02-10 09:00:00"],[3,"2026-02-14 09:00:00"],[3,"2026-02-12 09:00:00"],[4,"2026-02-09 09:00:00"],[4,"2026-02-08 09:00:00"],[4,"2026-02-08 18:00:00"],[4,"2026-02-07 09:00:00"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["user_id","longest_streak"],"rows":[[1,4],[2,3],[4,3]]}},{"input":{"tables":{"logins":{"columns":[["user_id","INT"],["login_at","TIMESTAMP"]],"rows":[[7,"2026-02-27 23:59:00"],[7,"2026-02-28 00:01:00"],[7,"2026-03-01 12:00:00"],[8,"2026-03-01 01:00:00"],[8,"2026-03-01 02:00:00"],[8,"2026-03-01 03:00:00"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["user_id","longest_streak"],"rows":[[7,3]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}